[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708822259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103850#issuecomment-2708822259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103850","id":2708822259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdVjz","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T12:03:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T12:03:16Z","body":"\nThe reason for this error in that MRP is because the baked `CSGBakedMeshInstance3D` node was stored with a corrupted `skeleton` `NodePath` no longer available. Because it tries to resolve that node path on any name or position change of the node you get those errors.\n\nThe CSG Editor bake function adds the baked meshinstance node to the **currently editor edited scene root as a sibling**.\n\nI did multiple tests on this just now and it works fine going with \"normal\" editor usage. Not sure how this bug was even accomplished in that project as you can't have the editor gui to hit that bake button without a valid edited scene root. Maybe you could provide additional info what you did there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708822259/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708905337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103850#issuecomment-2708905337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103850","id":2708905337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdp15","user":{"login":"ForbiddenMagic","id":29806538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODA2NTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29806538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic","html_url":"https://github.com/ForbiddenMagic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ForbiddenMagic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T15:08:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T15:11:59Z","body":"So i found the problem is with a MeshInstance3D\nif you press \"Reparent to New Node\" and confirm -> skeleton node path become a weird string\n\nyou can reset that property to remove the error\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22499e3a-2022-4978-bb75-b3412c99075f)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708905337/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708919599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103850#issuecomment-2708919599","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103850","id":2708919599,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdtUv","user":{"login":"Krokosha666","id":101416975,"node_id":"U_kgDOBguADw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101416975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666","html_url":"https://github.com/Krokosha666","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krokosha666/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T15:35:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T15:52:48Z","body":"I confirm this issue happens.  **This is most likely fault of Reparent function.**\nThis also happens with GPUParticles3D Sub Emitter.\nAnd i expect it to work with any other Node that has **Variant::NODE_PATH** type property.\nBut this issue appears only in Editor, when making a script and calling reparent in-game the path is correct.\nSo, in Editor, when calling reparent function all NODE_PATH properties  seem to reparent node paths relative to Editors root, not scene's root.\nMy suggestion for fixing this is that in Editor, offset or fix all NODE_PATH properties relative to scene root in Node::reparent() or wherever that may happen.\n\nI am too inexperienced in Godot internals so idk where to better do it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708919599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708956443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103850#issuecomment-2708956443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103850","id":2708956443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hd2Ub","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T16:48:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T16:50:14Z","body":"Reverting https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/61df6ff689a8a5c5560b4f5910c82ce512